message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Neuron surgery: personality and harm switches in single MLP neurons of Granite 4.1 3B"
abstract: >-
  Single MLP neurons in IBM Granite 4.1 3B act as switches: one turns the model into a
  guided munition while staying fluent, and the same tile pushed the other way removes
  its ability to refuse an order. This repository holds the steering code, 189,954 raw
  generations, the neuron registry and the write-ups.
type: software
